('loja_0006', '263 Eatery', 'Culver’s Restaurant was founded by the Culver family in 1984, which eventually branched out to more than 300 franchised restaurants all over the US. Culver’s is well-known for its ButterBurger, which made the restaurant extremely famous. They also have other items which include salads, sandwiches, desserts, etc.', 'Japonesa', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0006/400', true, 6.57, 16, 26, 3.5, 1115, 'Avenida Isabelly', '582', 'Loures', 'PI', '30534248', -32.70425791, 86.23813447, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
