('loja_0945', 'Spice Creamery', 'We are committed to using the finest ingredients in our recipes. No food leaves our kitchen that we ourselves would not eat.', 'Lanches', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0945/400', false, 5.81, 21, 41, 4.8, 1571, 'Viela Sophia Antunes', '8285', 'Penafiel', 'AP', '84049598', -7.53867598, 86.83846886, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0946', 'Thirsty Sushi', 'Yoshinoya is in business to create the structure and systems needed to allow our customers access to the majority of their away-from-home daily meal requirements on a one-stop-shop basis. All our products shall be of the highest quality and value, be healthy, nutritious and provided with outstanding personal services at the lowest possible prices consistent with a fair return on investment for our shareholders, job enhancementsecurity for our employees and a level of community involvement by everyone connected with our business. All of our products and services shall be delivered consistently and measured one satisfied customer at a time, whether by company-owned or franchised operations, in superior, clean, convenient, fun and friendly neighborhood environments. We pledge to make Yoshinoya the best place to eat and the best place to work.', 'Doces', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0946/400', false, 8.32, 18, 29, 3.3, 1463, 'Viela Augusto Vidal', 's/n', 'Pinhel', 'RN', '63397668', -8.50147534, 14.08868056, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0947', 'Orange Shakes', 'Culver’s Restaurant was founded by the Culver family in 1984, which eventually branched out to more than 300 franchised restaurants all over the US. Culver’s is well-known for its ButterBurger, which made the restaurant extremely famous. They also have other items which include salads, sandwiches, desserts, etc.', 'Lanches', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0947/400', true, 7.47, 29, 39, 3.3, 734, 'Rua Suélen Rezende', '58174', 'Rio Tinto', 'RN', '13556283', -80.48291984, 70.43669296, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0948', '621 Subs', 'SVIs mission is to deliver quality products at affordable prices to our independent retailers, wholesalers and food service partners around the world by providing international procurement, distribution, marketing and supply chain management.', 'Pizza', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0948/400', false, 11.47, 19, 38, 4.9, 1655, 'Ponte Lavínia', '3274', 'Samora Correia', 'AP', '85671857', -1.52565627, -97.80218382, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0949', 'Blue Dragon', 'Our mission is to be a leader in the distribution and merchandising of food, pharmacy, health and personal care items, seasonal merchandise, and related products and services. We place considerable importance on forging strong supplier partnerships. Our suppliers, large or small, local or global, are essential components in accomplishing our mission.', 'Japonesa', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0949/400', true, 14.18, 20, 37, 3.9, 1261, 'Travessa Luiz Gustavo Álvares', '95293', 'Mêda', 'CE', '08003352', 50.16325877, -144.03816436, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0950', 'Silver Eatery', 'We earn the loyalty of the people we serve by first anticipating, then fulfilling their needs with our superior-quality products, a unique shopping experience, customer-focused service and continuous innovation, while generating long-term profitable growth for our shareholders.', 'Pizza', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0950/400', true, 10.44, 22, 45, 3.8, 795, 'Alameda Luiz Gustavo de Assunção', 's/n', 'Lourosa', 'TO', '68410606', -1.24485636, 7.30869944, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0951', 'Thirsty Subs', 'To achieve and maintain such distinction in food and wine, service, atmosphere and setting that the restaurant gains a first class reputation for gastronomy, gracious and informed hospitality, comfort and beauty which draws new and repeat customers year after year. To achieve the above whilst upholding staff policies and practices which promote a fair and positive working environment. To be aware of and act on our responsibilities as a good corporate citizen to  provide a safe, clean and attractive place for guests to enjoy and for employees to work in - ensure ecologically sound management practices at the restaurant and in our surrounding gardens and woods - undertake meaningful involvement of Restaurant Les Fougères in selected charitable activities in our community and region.', 'Italiana', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0951/400', false, 10.89, 27, 37, 5.0, 622, 'Travessa Maria Eduarda Espinhosa', '9895', 'Leiria', 'RO', '83521267', -21.64859580, 174.42086257, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0952', 'Big Cafe', 'SVIs mission is to deliver quality products at affordable prices to our independent retailers, wholesalers and food service partners around the world by providing international procurement, distribution, marketing and supply chain management.', 'Italiana', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0952/400', true, 12.16, 28, 47, 4.3, 12, 'Viela Amanda Mendes', 's/n', 'Cartaxo', 'SE', '02599487', 81.78348030, -31.69577916, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0953', 'Spice Subs', 'To ensure that each guest receives prompt, professional, friendly and courteous service. To maintain a clean, comfortable and well maintained premises for our guests and staff. To provide at a fair price – nutritional, well-prepared meals – using only quality ingredients. To ensure that all guests and staff are treated with the respect and dignity they deserve. To thank each guest for the opportunity to serve them. By maintaining these objectives we shall be assured of a fair profit that will allow us to contribute to the community we serve.', 'Saudável', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0953/400', false, 4.02, 23, 37, 3.5, 1954, 'Avenida Adriana Soares', '84771', 'Amadora', 'SC', '38166092', -78.61989521, 120.79845069, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
