('loja_0990', 'Blue Plate Sushi', 'Culver’s Restaurant was founded by the Culver family in 1984, which eventually branched out to more than 300 franchised restaurants all over the US. Culver’s is well-known for its ButterBurger, which made the restaurant extremely famous. They also have other items which include salads, sandwiches, desserts, etc.', 'Japonesa', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0990/400', true, 5.85, 21, 31, 4.1, 1476, 'Travessa Maria Vitória Araújo', '71304', 'Alcácer do Sal', 'RS', '68130568', 12.76182581, -105.35725351, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
